  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math> be the number of all possible triangles formed by joining vertices of an&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>-sided regular polygon. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>,&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is :",
